    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d566">

                <pb facs="0567" n="1301" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1301"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-09"><hi rendition="#italic">September 9,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Translated letters found on Mooradian mark him as a revolutionary emissary. No
                    evidence of his armed resistance to the Turkish Government on Turkish soil. I
                    demanded his instant release on the ground that his imprisonment was
                    unauthorized. He is surrendered to me to be kept from correspondence until I can
                    send him out of Turkey.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
